  id: 'u3-2', unit: 'u3', code: '3.2', title: 'Robots and relationships', kicker: 'Listening', pages: '34–35', accent: 'pink', time: '2 × 60 min', sdg: '9 Industry, innovation and infrastructure',
  goal: 'Robots. Identifying important ideas. Present perfect with just, already, yet, ever, never, still.', split: 'Занятие 1: упр. 1–5. Занятие 2: упр. 6–11, Viewpoints.',
